  "detaljer": "ONE COMPLETE STANDING Lee-Harvey figure facing image right in three-quarter view, from the curled orange-brown quiff to BOTH black boots. The pink narrow long face has half-lidded tiny warm eyes, long nose, red skin-shadow, short dark mouth slit. Black leather jacket with DARK NAVY BLUE edge highlights, large open lapels and charcoal-gray cuffs, dark red undershirt, black trousers and pointed black boots edged in navy blue. Left-image fist at waist with curled fingers, right-image hand hangs to side, same asymmetry, boot spacing and contact points as source. Copy every finger cluster, jacket seam, trouser fold and boot silhouette. No extra buckles, jewelry, buttons or invented details. The jacket is predominantly BLACK, blue only the source edge highlights.",
